{
 "description": "Shared by tools/packcheck (Python) and internal/predicate (Go, T6.1). 'result' is the type the expression must have; 'error' is the code it must fail with. The scope uses the pack's evidence_descriptors and predicate_variables shapes. SYNTHETIC.",
 "scope": {
